apps/webui/frontend/tests/e2e/fixtures/stem-decode-bench.json
apps/webui/frontend/tests/e2e/fixtures/waveform-render.json
# Same builder again, its own data dir, for the hot-cue mapping gate (#736):
# both fixture tracks have no rekordbox mapping by construction.
apps/webui/frontend/tests/e2e/fixtures/hotcue-mapping-gate-data/
# Vocals demucs overlay e2e (#274): a clip of real vocal audio, its demucs
