apps/webui/frontend/tests/e2e/fixtures/autoplay-stall-gate-data/
# Throwaway 6-track library for the AutoPlay/mixing error hunt (#1853).
apps/webui/frontend/tests/e2e/fixtures/autoplay-error-hunt-data/
# Same builder again, its own data dir, for the karaoke lyrics suite (#2079,
# #2082): one track seeded with a real karaoke_words artifact, one left with
# no verdict row and a " (Remix)" title. Its manifest is rewritten on every
# run and names content-hash stable ids, so it is generated output, never a
