# --- personal agent toolkit must never enter this repo (going-public audit) ---
# Personal agent homes and messaging/identity workflows remain private.
# Ignore their handoff copies to prevent accidental reintroduction.
.planning/bifrost2-handoff/
**/sync-kit/
.codex/skills/
# NOT .claude/skills/ -- that is a tracked relative symlink to this repo's own
# .agents/skills and is legitimate. Listing it would imply the project's skills
# are a leak risk, and gitignore cannot affect a tracked path anyway.

# --- vendor controller documentation is never redistributed (going-public) ---
# Pioneer DJ / AlphaTheta / Reloop MIDI Message Lists are manufacturer
# copyright. Keep local copies here freely; they must not be committed.
# See docs/controller/reference/README.md.
docs/controller/reference/*.pdf
docs/controller/reference/*_MIDI_Message_List_*.txt

# Same vendor-copyright rule applies to the source PDFs, text extractions,
# and full-page renders the deck-diagram skill archives per device -- a
# rasterized manual page is still the manual's content, same as the text
# extraction. Only the derived midi.json/footnotes.md/layout.json/HTML and
# the CROPPED plate photo (source/plate-*.png) are ours to commit. See
# .agents/skills/deck-diagram-recreate/SKILL.md. 94 tracked full-page
# renders were removed as vendor copyright (PR #718, following the same
# BLOCKER 3 cleanup as the PDFs -- docs/oss-going-public-checklist.md).
tools/deck-diagrams/devices/*/source/*.pdf
tools/deck-diagrams/devices/*/source/*.txt
tools/deck-diagrams/devices/*/source/midi-list-page-*.png

# Rendered from fleet-af's com.af.autoreposync.plist.template at install time;
# it holds this machine absolute paths, which is exactly what must not be tracked.
ops/autoreposync/com.af.autoreposync.plist

